# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add`. The skill bodies live in
# `.agents/skills/`, `.claude/skills/` holds symlinks into them, and
# `skills-lock.json` pins the source tag — all three are tracked, because a
# clone without `.agents/` gets dangling symlinks. See AGENTS.md §6.
# Per-machine overrides stay local.
/.claude/settings.local.json
